# s04: end-to-end scenario for P1.1 (S4). The TUI process runs with the environment below; the
# runtime child is given exactly the HERDR_* variables buildChildEnv returns (plus PATH and HOME).
== B0, scenario s04
    TUI_ENV {"HERDR_ENV":"1","HERDR_PANE_ID":"w1:p2"}
    TUI_GATE closed
    CHILD HERDR_ENV="1"
    CHILD HERDR_PANE_ID="w1:p2"
    RUNTIME  observed 0 tool(s); HERDR_ENV=1 HERDR_BIN_PATH=<unset> HERDR_PANE_ID=w1:p2
    => TUI gate closed, runtime gate closed: P1.1 end to end holds
== B0, control (all three set)
    TUI_ENV {"HERDR_ENV":"1","HERDR_BIN_PATH":"/usr/local/bin/herdr","HERDR_PANE_ID":"w1:p2"}
